sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor VU as Viewer / User
    actor AD as Admin
    participant C as Client program<br/>(ollama-python / curl)
    participant G as IAM Gateway<br/>(port 8080)
    box Ollama (127.0.0.1 port 11434)
        participant H as Server<br/>(PullHandler)
        participant FS as Local store<br/>(~/.ollama/models)
    end
    participant REG as registry.ollama.ai

    rect rgb(253, 237, 237)
        Note over VU,G: Viewer / User: no models:manage permission
        VU->>C: pull gemma3
        C->>G: POST /api/pull {model}<br/>Authorization: Bearer (own key)
        G->>G: check key and role: refused, audited
        G-->>C: 403 Forbidden
        C-->>VU: show error
    end

    rect rgb(237, 247, 237)
        Note over AD,REG: Admin: allowed
        AD->>C: pull gemma3
        C->>G: POST /api/pull {model}<br/>Authorization: Bearer (admin's key)
        G->>G: check key and role: allowed
        G->>H: POST /api/pull {model} (key removed)
        H->>REG: GET manifest for library/gemma3:latest
        REG-->>H: manifest (list of layer digests)
        loop for each layer not already in the store
            par 16 parallel byte ranges
                H->>REG: GET blob (Range: bytes=a-b)
                REG-->>H: part of the blob
            end
            H->>FS: write blob part files
            H-->>G: progress (NDJSON)
            G-->>C: same line, streamed unchanged
            C-->>AD: show progress
        end
        H->>FS: verify SHA-256 digest of each blob
        H->>FS: write manifest
        H-->>G: status "success"
        G-->>C: status "success"
        C-->>AD: show "success"
        G->>G: audit the request (who, model, status)
    end
